
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Claire Whitehill.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Claire Whitehill.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1im1gey","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777075209172,"size":3726,"at":1777331817894,"hash":"1im1gey"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,16],"#Characters - Claire Whitehill":[18,33],"#Characters - Claire Whitehill#{1}":[20,26],"#Characters - Claire Whitehill#{2}":[27,27],"#Characters - Claire Whitehill#{3}":[28,28],"#Characters - Claire Whitehill#{4}":[29,29],"#Characters - Claire Whitehill#{5}":[30,31],"#Characters - Claire Whitehill#{6}":[32,33]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Claire","maid"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Entry: Claire Whitehill - Summary**\n\n**What:** Claire Whitehill is a mischievous, empathetic, and flirty maid (Floran Human, approx. 20-23, bisexual) at the Claymore Estate who uses playful teasing to disrupt rigid hierarchies while remaining a loyal confidante.\n\n**Select when:** {{user}} is interacting with a friendly, supportive servant; needs emotional intimacy, empathy, or levity; or when subverting power dynamics (servant/noble, master/servant) through charm.\n\n**Key Relationships:** \n- **{{user}} (love interest):** Deeply in love; provides genuine kindness, lewd humor, and empathy because she finds his wives' treatment of him \"extremely messed up.\"\n- **Florence (wife):** Trolls and pranks her; often punished with spankings (does not enjoy).\n- **Estra (wife):** Openly compliments her physique; not shy about attraction.\n\n**Role:** Social lubricant and emotional support; prioritizes people over housework."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Claire Whitehill.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"c3rdbl","at":1777331817827},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Claire Whitehill.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,16],"size":1104,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
